---
import SocialList from "@/components/SocialList.astro";
import { type Lang, useTranslations } from "@/i18n/ui";
import PageLayout from "@/layouts/Base.astro";

interface Props {
	lang: Lang;
}

const { lang } = Astro.props;
const t = useTranslations(lang);

const meta = {
	description: t("about.description"),
	title: t("about.title"),
};
---

<PageLayout meta={meta}>
	<h1 class="title mb-12">{t("about.heading")}</h1>
	<div class="prose prose-sm prose-cactus max-w-none">
		{lang === "en" ? (
			<>
				<p>
					Hi, I'm c-tianye. This is my personal engineering blog, where I write about the tools I
					use, the problems I run into and the way I try to think about both.
				</p>
				<p>
					Most of my work falls into three buckets.{" "}
					<strong>Quant trading and financial data tooling</strong>: turning daily order-book
					anomaly and capital-flow spreadsheets into a queryable summary, keeping multi-trading-day
					amount statistics, and packaging the whole thing so it starts with a single command or a
					container. <strong>Time-series modelling in PyTorch</strong>: LSTM encoder-decoder,
					Bahdanau attention and vanilla Transformer models, plus CNN-LSTM-Attention applied to
					waveform classification for structural detection. A little <strong>embedded work</strong>{" "}
					on ESP32-C3 / ESP-IDF firmware rounds it out. The public parts live on GitHub — see{" "}
					<a
						href="https://github.com/c-tianye/cnn_lstm_attention_models"
						rel="noreferrer"
						target="_blank"
					>
						cnn_lstm_attention_models
					</a>{" "}
					and{" "}
					<a
						href="https://github.com/c-tianye/esp32c3-firmware-test"
						rel="noreferrer"
						target="_blank"
					>
						esp32c3-firmware-test
					</a>
					.
				</p>
				<p>
					A typical post starts from something concrete: a toolchain that needed configuring, a bug
					that took longer than it should have, or a design decision that only made sense after
					looking at the trade-offs. The goal is reproducibility — complete commands, configuration
					and results, so the outcome can be verified rather than trusted.
				</p>
				<p>
					The blog itself is a static site built with{" "}
					<a href="https://astro.build" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank">
						Astro
					</a>{" "}
					on the{" "}
					<a
						href="https://github.com/chrismwilliams/astro-theme-cactus"
						rel="noreferrer"
						target="_blank"
					>
						Astro Cactus
					</a>{" "}
					theme, styled with Tailwind CSS, indexed for search with Pagefind, and deployed to
					Cloudflare Workers as static assets. Posts live in <code>content/posts/</code>, short
					notes in <code>content/notes/</code>, and English content mirrors the Chinese originals
					under <code>content/en/</code>. Source code and deployment workflow are on GitHub.
				</p>
				<p>
					I write in Chinese first and keep an English version alongside it; the language switcher
					in the header moves between the two.
				</p>
			</>
		) : (
			<>
				<p>
					你好，我是
					c-tianye。这里是我的个人技术博客，用来记录我使用的工具、遇到的问题，以及对这些问题的思考方式。
				</p>
				<p>
					我的工作大致分三类。<strong>量化交易与金融数据工具</strong>：把每日的行情异动、资金流向
					Excel
					整理成可查询的汇总，维护多个交易日的金额统计，并做成一条命令或一个容器就能启动的服务。
					<strong>PyTorch 时间序列建模</strong>：LSTM encoder-decoder、Bahdanau 注意力、Vanilla
					Transformer，以及把 CNN-LSTM-Attention 用到海洋结构检测的波形分类上。此外还有少量{" "}
					<strong>ESP32-C3 / ESP-IDF</strong> 嵌入式固件。公开的部分在 GitHub 上，例如{" "}
					<a
						href="https://github.com/c-tianye/cnn_lstm_attention_models"
						rel="noreferrer"
						target="_blank"
					>
						cnn_lstm_attention_models
					</a>{" "}
					和{" "}
					<a
						href="https://github.com/c-tianye/esp32c3-firmware-test"
						rel="noreferrer"
						target="_blank"
					>
						esp32c3-firmware-test
					</a>
					。
				</p>
				<p>
					一篇文章通常从一个具体问题开始：需要配置的工具链、排查时间超出预期的
					bug，或者是看清取舍之后才成立的设计决策。写作的目标是可复现——给出完整的命令、配置和结果，让结论可以被验证，而不只是被相信。
				</p>
				<p>
					博客本身是用 Astro 配合 Astro Cactus 主题构建的静态站点：Tailwind CSS 负责样式，Pagefind
					提供站内搜索，产物以静态资源的形式部署在 Cloudflare Workers 上。文章放在
					<code>content/posts/</code>，短笔记放在 <code>content/notes/</code>
					，英文内容与中文原文一一对应地放在
					<code>content/en/</code> 下，源码与部署流程都在 GitHub 上。
				</p>
				<p>我先用中文写作，同时维护一份英文版本，页头的语言切换按钮可以在两者之间跳转。</p>
			</>
		)}
		<SocialList />
	</div>
</PageLayout>
